# Top UI Code of the Future

Below is a modular, trend-forward UI scaffold embracing glassmorphism, 3D depth, micro-interactions, and adaptive theming. Each section can be extended with AI hooks, AR integrations, or voice commands—perfect for 2025 and beyond.

---

