## CSS Styles (`styles.css`)

```css
:root {
  --bg-light: #f0f4f8;
  --bg-dark: #121418;
  --glass-light: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  --glass-dark: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  --accent: #5e76f0;
  --text-light: #ffffff;
  --text-dark: #222222;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 2rem;
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg-light);
  color: var(--text-dark);
  transition: background 0.4s, color 0.4s;
}

#theme-toggle {
  position: fixed;
  top: 1rem;
  right: 1rem;
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
  background: var(--accent);
  border: none;
  border-radius: 0.25rem;
  color: white;
  cursor: pointer;
  mix-blend-mode: difference;
}

.dashboard {
  display: flex;
  gap: 2rem;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.card {
  position: relative;
  width: 280px;
  padding: 2rem;
  border-radius: 1rem;
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease, background 0.4s;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.card h2 {
  margin-top: 0;
}

.card p {
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.cta {
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
  background: var(--accent);
  border: none;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
  color: white;
  font-weight: bold;
  transition: transform 0.2s;
}

.cta:hover {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}

/* Glassmorphism Card */
.card.glass {
  background: var(--glass-light);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

/* 3D-inflated Card */
.card.three-d {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: white;
}
.card.three-d:hover {
  transform: perspective(600px) rotateX(5deg) rotateY(5deg) scale(1.03);
}

/* Dark Mode Overrides */
body.dark {
  background: var(--bg-dark);
  color: var(--text-light);
}
body.dark .card.glass {
  background: var(--glass-dark);
}
```

